Subject: Route the New Tab accelerator to the universal launcher

Krypton separates Ctrl+T (universal launcher) from Ctrl+L (current URL).
Route the existing captured-accelerator path to an optional ABI-v2 UI tail;
explicit New tab commands still create a Chromium tab. Preserve command policy,
keyboard metrics, deferred dispatch and the existing old-runtime fallback.
This changes browser UI shortcut dispatch only; V8, Blink and rendering stay
unchanged.

